  the base URL already uses — e.g. [38;5;153mVERIFY = os.environ.get("REPORTS_VERIFY_TLS", "1") != "0"[39m passed as [38;5;153mverify=VERIFY[39m,
  with [38;5;153msync_staging.py[39m setting [38;5;153mREPORTS_VERIFY_TLS=0[39m. Better still is pointing staging at its CA bundle
  ([38;5;153mverify="/path/to/staging-ca.pem"[39m), which keeps verification on everywhere.
